is not eligible\\n    input_file: testdata/no-deployer-role.json\\n    expect:\\n      decision: deny\\n      reason: not_eligible\\n  - name: a deploy outside production is not eligible\\n    input_file: testdata/staging.json\\n    expect:\\n      decision: deny\\n      reason: not_eligible\\n  - name: a service without the ga lifecycle label is not eligible\\n    input_file: testdata/beta-lifecycle.json\\n    expect:\\n      decision: deny\\n      reason: not_eligible\\n\\n  # deny soak_too_short: payments lowers the platform's 24h minimum to 4h.\\n  - name: a 2h soak is denied\\n    input_file: testdata/short-soak.json\\n    expect:\\n      decision: deny\\n      reason: soak_too_short\\n  - name: a 2h soak on a hotfix is not denied\\n    input_file: testdata/short-soak-hotfix.json\\n    expect:\\n      decision: review\\n      reason: service_owner\\n      payload:\\n        approvers: [payments-leads, security-leads]\\n  - name: a soak of exactly the team's 4h minimum is not denied\\n    input_file: testdata/min-soak.json\\n    expect:\\n      decision: review\\n      reason: service_owner\\n\\n  # deny no_rule_matched: eligible, but no rule fires, so the kind's default wins.\\n  - name: an owner's deploy of a critical service, outside the default tiers, matches no rule\\n    input_file: testdata/critical-tier.json\\n    expect:\\n      decision: deny\\n      reason: no_rule_matched\\n  - name: a deploy by someone who doesn't own the service matches no rule\\n    input_file: testdata/not-owner.json\\n    expect:\\n      decision: deny\\n      reason: no_rule_matched\\n\\n  # cleared: every region in the regions label must be one of the actor's.\\n  - name: an owner not cleared for every region of the service gets nothing from deploy.production\\n    input_file: testdata/uncleared-region.json\\n    expect:\\n      decision: deny\\n      reason: no_rule_matched\\n  - name: payments-sre not cleared for every region of the service doesn't approve\\n    input_file: 